SELECT 'gongkao', '工程问题', 'kp-xingce-quantity-math-operation-engineering', CAST($${"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 1}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "工程问题"}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#fffbeb", "borderColor": "#f59e0b", "icon": "💡"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "核心心法：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "工程总量 = 工作效率 × 工作时间。解题核心只有三个字：【赋值法】。绝对不要设工程总量为 1 ！"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "一、题型定义与识别"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "题目中出现“工程”、“加工零件”、“修路”、“抽水”等工作场景，且已知条件往往只给时间（如：甲独做需10天，乙独做需15天），或者只给效率比例。"}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "二、核心公式"}]}, {"type": "katexBlock", "attrs": {"content": "W (总量) = P (效率) \\times T (时间)"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "三、标准步骤（赋值法两条铁律）"}]}, {"type": "text-diagram", "attrs": {"type": "mermaid", "content": "flowchart TD\nA[阅读题干判断属于哪种类型] --> B{题目给了什么已知条件?}\nB -- 只给时间 --> C[将总量 W 赋值为所给时间的 最小公倍数]\nB -- 给出效率之比 --> D[直接将效率 P 赋值为所给的比例数字]\nC --> E[反推出各自的效率 P]\nD --> F[计算出工程的总量 W]\nE --> G[根据题意列出方程求解]\nF --> G"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "四、例题完整推导"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "【例题】", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " 一项工程，甲单独做需要 10 天，乙单独做需要 15 天。现在甲乙合作，需要几天完成？选项：A. 5  B. 6  C. 8  D. 12"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"start": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "识别：典型的只给“时间”的工程问题。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "第一步（赋值总量）：10 和 15 的最小公倍数是 30。直接设工程总量 W = 30。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "第二步（推导效率）：甲的效率 P甲 = 30 ÷ 10 = 3；乙的效率 P乙 = 30 ÷ 15 = 2。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "第三步（列式求解）：甲乙合作，总效率为 P总 = 3 + 2 = 5。合作时间 T = W ÷ P总 = 30 ÷ 5 = 6 天。"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "锁定答案：选 B。"}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "五、易错点纠偏"}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#fef2f2", "borderColor": "#ef4444", "icon": "⚠️"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "老实巴交设总量为 1：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "初中数学教我们设总量为1，导致甲的效率是 1/10，乙是 1/15，相加变成 1/10 + 1/15 = 5/30 = 1/6，再除以1得到6。在行测考场上，分数加减法极易出错且耗时，必须用“最小公倍数赋值法”把所有数据转化为整数！"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "六、刷题建议"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "专门训练找最小公倍数的能力。看到 12 和 15 立刻反应出 60，看到 20 和 30 立刻反应出 60。看到“甲效率是乙的3倍”，立刻在试卷上写下 P甲=3，P乙=1。"}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '工程问题的核心考点与实战推导。', category_node.id, CAST('["数量关系", "数学运算", "工程问题"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_xingce_quantity_math_operation_engineering", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
